# npm pack artifacts. Exception (force-added with `git add -f`): the CURRENT
# versioned @wip/* tarballs in libs/ that package.json pins — they must be
# in-repo so a CI runner can `npm ci` + build images from git content alone
# (CASE-442: versioned filenames are immutable, so lockfile integrity hashes
# can never silently mismatch). On a lib refresh: git rm the old .tgz,
# git add -f the new ones.
*.tgz
.claude/.session-id
.claude/.session-role
.claude-context-pct
.DS_Store
.mcp.json
.claude/kb.json
.claude/settings.local.json
